    docs: scope README CI-green claim to proved kernel matrix (TJ-DF-028)
    
    README "CI green" was unscoped — a reader on a kernel without unprivileged
    PID namespace support would see green and assume the full suite proved the
    containment boundary on their host. The claim is now scoped to the proved
    kernel matrix (Ubuntu 26.04 / 7.0.0-30-generic, pinned in
    docs/backend-parity.md) and the HOST-DEGRADED-PIDNS skip marker in
    test_backend_parity.py is called out.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
